---
import { principles } from '../data/principles';
---

<section
  id="about"
  aria-labelledby="about-heading"
  class="border-t border-line"
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-content px-5 md:px-8 py-20 md:py-32">
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-12 gap-10 md:gap-16">
      <div class="md:col-span-3">
        <h2
          id="about-heading"
          class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.22em] uppercase text-subtle font-medium"
        >
          01 / About
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="md:col-span-9">
        <p
          class="font-display text-[clamp(1.4rem,3vw,2.1rem)] leading-[1.35] tracking-tightish text-ink max-w-3xl font-medium"
        >
          I build iOS apps that work in markets others overlook.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-7 space-y-5 max-w-2xl text-[16px] md:text-[17px] text-muted leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            Over 7 years I've shipped real estate, banking, healthcare, and
            education apps for users across Saudi Arabia, the UAE, and
            Europe &mdash; including Arabic-first experiences with complex
            RTL layouts, real-time features, and strict compliance
            requirements (HIPAA, banking security).
          </p>
          <p>
            I work in Swift, SwiftUI, UIKit, and Objective-C, and I care
            about architecture, performance, and shipping things that
            actually work in production.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-12 md:mt-16 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 md:gap-8">
          {principles.map((p) => (
            <div class="flex flex-col">
              <span class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.22em] uppercase text-accent font-semibold">
                {p.number}
              </span>
              <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-[18px] md:text-[19px] text-ink font-semibold tracking-tightish">
                {p.title}
              </h3>
              <p class="mt-2 text-[14px] md:text-[15px] text-muted leading-relaxed">
                {p.body}
              </p>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
